#### Figures checked in code
Method ValueMatch: figures must agree exactly.
Every number the report asserts, checked against every number in the passages above. This arithmetic is established — do not redo it. It does not decide the requirement: a figure can match and still be the wrong figure, from the wrong document or as at the wrong date, which is what the guards below are for.

